<title>ITALY: Italy oil product consumption fell in September.</title>
<headline>Italy oil product consumption fell in September.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian consumption of petroleum products fell 2.0 percent to 7.5 million tonnes in September, compared with the same month in 1995, according to data from trade group Unione Petrolifera.</p>
<p>  Category			1996 (000 tonnes)  Chg vs 1995</p>
<p>  Total				7,500		  -2.0 pct</p>
<p>  Total gasoline		   1,400		  -3.6 pct</p>
<p>  Total gas oil		    1,200		 -13.0 pct</p>
<p>In the first nine months of this year, consumption of oil products fell 1.0 percent over the same 1995 period to 69.5 million tonnes, UP said.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
